# Copy to .env.local. Both keys are optional: the app can run on keys that each visitor
# brings in the browser instead. Whichever vendor has a key routes prompts with its small
# model and answers with its bigger ones.
#
# GEMINI_API_KEY    classifier (and answers, when it is the only key)  https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY answers over the API                               https://console.anthropic.com/
# Locally, with no Anthropic key, answers come from your own Claude Code instead.
#
# Anything set here answers for everyone who can reach the deployment, on your billing.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Pairing, set for you by `npm run pair` — do not set these by hand.
# CANOPY_ALLOW_ORIGIN  the one deployed site allowed to reach this app from a browser
# CANOPY_PAIR_TOKEN    the secret that site must send; regenerated on every pair run
